# HoneyBeeSMP — Minecraft mods
#
# One mod per line, in the format:
#
#     <mod-file-name>.jar  <download-url>
#
# The deploy script downloads any mod listed here that is missing from the
# target server, and removes mods that are no longer listed. This keeps the
# dev and live servers on exactly the same mod set, promoted through git.
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# A mod is installed by adding its line here, then running:
#     ./scripts/deploy.sh minecraft <env>
#
# Example:
#   create-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar  https://example.com/create-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar
#
# Currently no mods are installed.

sodium-neoforge-0.8.13+mc1.21.1.jar  https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AANobbMI/versions/uMOpc5uV/sodium-neoforge-0.8.13%2Bmc1.21.1.jar
Terralith_1.21.1_v2.6.2_Neoforge.jar  https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8oi3bsk5/versions/IY93YaEe/Terralith_1.21.1_v2.6.2_Neoforge.jar
